Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `INFO` is a constant, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/reflection_fact_constant_is_read_only.jet:12:10
    |
 12 |     INFO.name = "Other"
    |          ^^^^
 Why: Static storage is not mutable
 Fix: Copy the value into a mutable local (`:=`) and change that
